# Diagnostic serial interval as a novel indicator for contact tracing effectiveness exemplified with the SARS-CoV-2/COVID-19 outbreak in South Korea

![](images/3658d29e657610cd5fc7607b7c79bc33032a2b4264ffc376050500652b3341db.jpg)

Sofia K. Mettlera,b,1, *, Jihoo Kimc,2 , Marloes H. Maathuisa,3

a Seminar for Statistics, Department of Mathematics, ETH Zurich, Ramistrasse 101, 8092 Zurich, Switzerland   
b Faculty of Medicine, University of Zurich, Ramistrasse 71, 8006 Zurich, Switzerland   
