y investigates COVID-19.,4,Focuses on human outbreak clusters in Singapore and Tianjin.,4,Real-world geographic context in Singapore and China.,4,Reports original empirical analysis of outbreak cluster data to estimate transmission parameters.,4,Directly estimates and reports the generation interval and serial interval from symptom onset data.,1.0,,,,"Title: Estimating the generation interval for coronavirus disease (COVID-19) based on symptom onset data, March 2020.

