Among 46 children $< 1 8$ years, 28 $( 6 0 . 9 \% )$ were mild, 17 $( 3 7 . 0 \% )$ were moderate and 1 $( 2 . 2 \% )$ was severe. The severe case was a three-year-old child with leukemia.

