# 3.7. Reproduction number

Forty-three cases $( 7 8 . 2 \% )$ did not have secondary transmission events. Twelve cases transmitted the disease to 23 secondary cases, yielding an R of 1.92 (range, 1-5) for those 12 cases and 0.42 (range, 0-5) for all 55 cases.

